---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Popular Diets Explained: Keto, Mediterranean & More — Nawtch"
  description="In-depth, evidence-based guides to popular diets — Mediterranean, DASH, intermittent fasting, keto, plant-based/vegan, paleo, MIND, Whole30, flexible dieting (IIFYM), flexitarian, and Volumetrics — each with its own page, cited research, food examples, and sources."
  canonicalPath="/diets/"
  bodyClass="diets"
>
  <header>
    <div class="header-left">
      <h1>Popular Diets & Their Evidence</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Popular, well-studied eating patterns — one page per diet, evidence-based and non-promotional.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="ghost-btn" style="font-size:12px;padding:6px 12px;" href="#" onclick="window.history.back(); return false;">← Back</a>
  </header>

  <p class="field-hint" style="margin:-4px 0 14px;">
    Educational only, not medical advice! No diet here is presented as "the best" — each has different evidence behind it, and different people it suits. Want your numbers first? Our <a href="/calculators/">calculators</a> can get you a calorie or macro target to start with.
  </p>

  <div class="items-section">
    <a class="tool-card" href="/diets/mediterranean/">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-icon">water_drop</span>
      <div class="tool-card-info">
        <div class="tool-card-name">Mediterranean Diet</div>
        <div class="tool-card-desc">Vegetables, olive oil, and fish — one of the most rigorously studied diets for heart health.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-arrow">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/diets/dash/">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-icon">favorite</span>
      <div class="tool-card-info">
        <div class="tool-card-name">DASH Diet</div>
        <div class="tool-card-desc">An NIH-developed eating pattern built specifically to lower blood pressure.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-arrow">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/diets/intermittent-fasting/">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-icon">schedule</span>
      <div class="tool-card-info">
        <div class="tool-card-name">Intermittent Fasting</div>
        <div class="tool-card-desc">Changes when you eat, not what — from 16:8 time-restriction to alternate-day fasting.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-arrow">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/diets/keto/">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-icon">egg_alt</span>
      <div class="tool-card-info">
        <div class="tool-card-name">Ketogenic (Keto) Diet</div>
        <div class="tool-card-desc">A very-low-carb, high-fat approach that shifts your metabolism toward ketosis.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-arrow">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/diets/plant-based/">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-icon">eco</span>
      <div class="tool-card-info">
        <div class="tool-card-name">Plant-Based & Vegan Diets</div>
        <div class="tool-card-desc">Built around whole plant foods, with two different levels of how strict to go.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-arrow">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/diets/flexitarian/">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-icon">balance</span>
      <div class="tool-card-info">
        <div class="tool-card-name">Flexitarian Diet</div>
        <div class="tool-card-desc">Mostly plant-based, with meat as an occasional addition rather than a daily staple.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-arrow">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/diets/paleo/">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-icon">outdoor_grill</span>
      <div class="tool-card-info">
        <div class="tool-card-name">Paleo Diet</div>
        <div class="tool-card-desc">Lean meats, fish, fruits, and vegetables — modeled on pre-agricultural eating.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-arrow">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/diets/mind/">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-icon">psychology</span>
      <div class="tool-card-info">
        <div class="tool-card-name">MIND Diet</div>
        <div class="tool-card-desc">A Mediterranean-DASH hybrid designed specifically to support long-term brain health.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-arrow">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/diets/whole30/">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-icon">calendar_month</span>
      <div class="tool-card-info">
        <div class="tool-card-name">Whole30</div>
        <div class="tool-card-desc">A structured 30-day elimination-and-reintroduction reset, not a long-term diet.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-arrow">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/diets/flexible-dieting/">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-icon">tune</span>
      <div class="tool-card-info">
        <div class="tool-card-name">Flexible Dieting (IIFYM)</div>
        <div class="tool-card-desc">No foods off-limits — just hit your daily protein, carb, and fat targets.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-arrow">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/diets/volumetrics/">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-icon">water_full</span>
      <div class="tool-card-info">
        <div class="tool-card-name">Volumetrics</div>
        <div class="tool-card-desc">Eats for fullness by choosing lower-calorie-density foods, not by cutting food groups.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-arrow">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/diets/low-fodmap/">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-icon">air</span>
      <div class="tool-card-info">
        <div class="tool-card-name">Low-FODMAP Diet</div>
        <div class="tool-card-desc">A short-term diagnostic elimination diet developed for IBS, not a general long-term plan.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-arrow">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/diets/blue-zones/">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-icon">elderly</span>
      <div class="tool-card-info">
        <div class="tool-card-name">Blue Zones Diet</div>
        <div class="tool-card-desc">Legume-heavy and plant-forward, from five regions studied for longevity — with real disputes over the data.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-arrow">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/diets/carnivore/">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-icon">kebab_dining</span>
      <div class="tool-card-info">
        <div class="tool-card-name">Carnivore Diet</div>
        <div class="tool-card-desc">All animal products, zero plant foods — strong anecdotes, essentially no long-term trials.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-arrow">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/diets/eating-on-glp-1/">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-icon">vaccines</span>
      <div class="tool-card-info">
        <div class="tool-card-name">Eating on GLP-1 Medications</div>
        <div class="tool-card-desc">Practical nutrition guidance for the much smaller appetite semaglutide, tirzepatide, and similar drugs create.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined tool-card-arrow">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
